<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- saved from url=(0038)https://save-apt.ggagossam.com/teacher -->
<html lang="ko"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>선생님 보드 관리 · 문제 아파트</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#fdf0e4">
<link rel="icon" href="https://save-apt.ggagossam.com/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="preload" href="https://save-apt.ggagossam.com/fonts/Paperlogy-800.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./선생님 보드 관리 · 문제 아파트_files/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <a class="brand" href="https://save-apt.ggagossam.com/index.html" aria-label="활동으로 가기"><svg class="aptico" viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="34" height="34" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="5" width="24" height="31" rx="2.5" fill="#f4a261" stroke="#2a211d" stroke-width="2.4"></rect><rect x="13" y="5" width="14" height="6" fill="#e76f51" stroke="#2a211d" stroke-width="2.4"></rect><g fill="#fff6c9" stroke="#2a211d" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="12" y="14" width="5" height="5" rx="1"></rect><rect x="23" y="14" width="5" height="5" rx="1"></rect><rect x="12" y="22" width="5" height="5" rx="1"></rect><rect x="23" y="22" width="5" height="5" rx="1"></rect></g><rect x="17" y="29" width="6" height="7" fill="#7a4a2b" stroke="#2a211d" stroke-width="1.8"></rect></svg><b class="wordmark">문제 아파트를 구해줘!</b></a>
  <nav class="steps"><span class="roomchip" style="background:var(--teal)">선생님 보드 관리</span></nav>
  <div class="top-r"><img class="brandlogo" src="./선생님 보드 관리 · 문제 아파트_files/logo.webp" width="640" height="210" alt="까망이고동이 × 두클래스"></div>
</header>
<main class="bd-wrap" id="app">
  <div class="tgrid">
    <section class="card" id="mk">
      <h2><span class="no">1</span>새 보드 만들기</h2>
      <p class="guide">수업마다 보드를 하나 만들어요. <b>마지막 활동 30일 뒤에 자동으로 지워져요.</b> 만들면 나오는 <b>6자리 코드</b>를 칠판에 써 주세요.</p>
      <form id="mkForm" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="field"><label for="mkName">보드 이름</label><input class="input" id="mkName" maxlength="40" autocomplete="off" placeholder="예) 4학년 3반 제안하는 글"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="mkPw">관리 비밀번호 <small style="font-weight:700;color:var(--muted)">(6글자 이상, 나만 알기)</small></label><input class="input" id="mkPw" type="password" maxlength="40" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="글 삭제·잠그기에 필요해요"></div>
        <button class="btn coral" type="submit">보드 만들기</button>
      </form>
      <div id="mkOut" class="mkout" hidden=""></div>
    </section>
    <section class="card" id="lg">
      <h2><span class="no">2</span>내 보드 관리하기</h2>
      <p class="guide">코드와 관리 비밀번호를 입력하면 글을 보고 정리할 수 있어요.</p>
      <form id="lgForm" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="field"><label for="lgCode">보드 코드</label><input class="input" id="lgCode" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" autocomplete="off"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="lgPw">관리 비밀번호</label><input class="input" id="lgPw" type="password" maxlength="40" autocomplete="current-password"></div>
        <button class="btn teal" type="submit">불러오기</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="card" id="mine" hidden="">
    <h2><span class="no">3</span>내 보드 목록 <small style="font-weight:700;color:var(--muted)">(이 기기에서 만든 보드)</small></h2>
    <div class="minelist" id="minelist"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="panel" hidden="">
    <div class="bd-head" style="margin-top:22px">
      <h1 id="pName"></h1><span class="bd-code" id="pCode"></span><span class="bd-lock" id="pLock" hidden="">올리기 잠김</span><span class="count" id="pCount"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tbar">
      <button class="btn sm" id="bLock" type="button">올리기 잠그기</button>
      <a class="btn sm soft" id="bView" href="https://save-apt.ggagossam.com/teacher#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">보드 화면 열기</a>
      <button class="btn sm soft" id="bCsv" type="button">글 모두 저장하기(표)</button>
      <button class="btn sm soft" id="bClear" type="button">모든 글 지우기</button>
      <button class="btn sm soft" id="bRemove" type="button">보드 없애기</button>
      <button class="btn sm soft" id="bOut" type="button">나가기</button>
    </div>
    <div class="tlist" id="tlist"></div>
  </section>
  <p id="msg" style="margin-top:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted)"></p>
</main>
<div id="modal" class="modal" hidden="" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"></div>
<div id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
